<title>UK: Spintab sets $50 mln December 1998 FRN.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets $50 mln December 1998 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AB SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  MATURITY    30.DEC.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  10 BP     ISS PRICE  100.10    LISTING    LONDON</p>
<p> MOODY'S    AA3</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
